  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Swellchain Bridge is the canonical bridge for Swellchain, enabling asset transfers between Ethereum and the Swellchain L2. It uses the OP Stack bridge architecture to lock assets on L1 and mint equivalent representations on L2.",
